  2	    <#
  3	    .SYNOPSIS
  4	        Checks the applicable CIS DMARC requirement for each accepted domain.
  5	
  6	    .DESCRIPTION
  7	        Looks up the DMARC record that applies to each accepted domain, falling back to the organisational domain when the domain has no valid record, including a malformed record. Sending domains require quarantine or reject, 100 percent coverage, and mailto aggregate (rua) and forensic (ruf) report addresses. Parked or otherwise non-sending domains require a valid record with p=reject. Ambiguous domain-use evidence is reported for investigation when the two procedures produce different results.
